st two heroes in the party, and four arrows fly from the slits in the walls at whoever is left standing in the room. In my version the arrows went after the two heroes who were already sliding down the chute, which was bad enough, but he found someth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:57:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696265","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:29:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1845383656385270","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Blood Sword hit 7000 Wishlists + Version 0.3.0 is live!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/64787ca5ada7eee481246b0404975f08cb82775c.png We just crossed 7,000 wishlists! Hey, everyone! I have been blown away by the reception of the demo, and the wishlist counter has now passed 7,000. Two weeks ago I confessed to refreshing the stats page like a madman, and I would love to tell you I have calmed down since, but I am still at it, as if I haven't released games for the past 7 years already. For a lone developer the excitement is always pumped up to the sky :) B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T07:35:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1844115010495466","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v.0.2.0 is live!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/662039a478a6ab793193c20d8fc9d94fdf506428.png The demo just crossed 1,100 installs, and I am still refreshing the stats page like a madman! Hey, everyone! It's been a crazy week for me as I finally got to the first major milestone - giving the demo to the public. I am overjoyed with all the reactions, the kind words and feedback I've received over the last four days. Naturally, I waited the entire week to patch the game on a Friday night, with my late evening coffee al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T16:54:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1843481262701981","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"The Blood Sword demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/89d2ef8c35a33cd661d9196dcca9334c3dce9ab4.png Hey everyone! I am super excited to bring you the first major milestone for Blood Sword! The Blood Sword demo is live on Steam, and it arrives on the first day of the Party-Based RPG Fest, which runs from September 14 to 21. You get the opening of The Kingdom of Wyrd with all four heroes, from the first campfire in the forest to the shores of Wyrd, and you can download it right now from the store page! https://store.steampo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T15:13:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701981","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1840310314347479","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Mini Devlog #6: Four heroes, one plan","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/5b00bbf6e57903361864c1909ca31cc024407062.png Hey everyone, I shoved a werewolf into a field of caltrops last month and nothing happened. It padded across the spikes without a scratch and went straight for my Sage on the other side. I sat there for a good while wondering which half of the plan was broken, the push or the caltrops, or whether I had invented the whole combination in my head. It turned out that knockback places a unit on a tile, while hazards only fire wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T13:37:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1837955055366163","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Mini Devlog #5: Rewriting the rules of magic","summary":"Hey everyone! Last time, I signed off saying I was drafting out how the Enchanter's spells from the books would work on the grid. Well, the past month has been almost entirely devoted to that - and to building out the full skill system for all four classes. Today I want to talk about one of the biggest deviations from the source material I've made so far: changing the books' spell system. I know some of you gamebook veterans will have opinions on this, so let me walk you through exactly what I c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T13:48:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366163","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1834602721201737","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Mini Devlog #4: Translating the tabletop grid to a screen","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/a1f31e0dce850c4cdda218807ab779ebc7674f0c.png Hey everyone, If you've been following the game here on Steam, you've mostly seen static screenshots of hex grids and character models. But lately, I’ve been spending almost all of my time deep in the combat engine, trying to answer one big question: how do I make a classic paper-and-pencil gamebook feel good as a digital PC game? In the original Blood Sword books, your imagination does all the heavy lifting. You roll the d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T13:15:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201737","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1829528821312223","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Mini Devlog #3: Chickenpox, Curses, and Adapting Paper to Code","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/5104f2b5e340688985a75248c624e3bc447d43c5.png I know it’s been a while since my last update, and honestly, the silence wasn't part of any master marketing plan. Over the last month, half my family came down with Chickenpox. Balancing the roles of a dad, a makeshift nurse, and an indie developer meant something had to give. Naturally, I couldn't stop the development train, so I just put my head down, drank too much coffee, and kept grinding out code in the quiet hours. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-11T14:08:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821312223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1826362059931191","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Blood Sword joins Turn-Based Thursday Fest 2026!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/af3f5ba54d02720c7ebb2e0c6000a92e91370603.png Folks, I have some massive news to share! Blood Sword has been hand-selected to participate in the Turn-Based Thursday Fest 2026, running from March 9th to March 16th! It is an absolute honor to see the game featured alongside genre-defining titans like Darkest Dungeon, Battle Brothers, Pathfinder, Vagrus, dotAge, and many, many others! I am especially proud to be featured in the \"Promising Unknowns\" section - a dedicated s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T18:39:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059931191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1823825466501717","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"5,000 Wishlists Reached! + A Small Tease","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/e7c4a9b8c7e162ad23bb086c0a7dd9b7fa6f3315.png We’ve crossed the 5,000 wishlist mark! When I celebrated reaching 3,000 back in late September, I was already thrilled. But hitting 5,000 before the demo is even live? I am beyond humbled yet excited to see where Blood Sword can go! To everyone who has joined the community recently: thank you. Every wishlist boosts the visibility of Blood Sword and helps this indie project gain traction against the giants of the genre. A Sm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-07T14:20:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466501717","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1822556746164002","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Mini Devlog #2: Refining Passive Skills","summary":"Folks, it's been over a month since the Italian and Bulgarian localization announcement, so here's what's been happening in my indie dev world.The past few weeks focused on core RPG systems - specifically how character skills interact with spells, equipment, items, and inventory management. Less flashy than combat or story, but these are the systems you'll interact with constantly.Spellcasting & MemorizationThe spellcasting system received significant work this month. Spell memorization now func","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-24T15:28:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746164002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1819386365089850","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"update","title":"End of Year Update - Blood Sword in Italian and Bulgarian","summary":"Blood Sword was never just an English series. From the very beginning, it travelled across borders and languages, finding devoted readers in different countries, each with their own editions, terminology, and memories tied to these books. That multicultural life is part of what kept the series alive long after its original release, and it’s something I want to preserve in the digital adaptation. The end of the year felt like the right moment to pause and refocus. I released a new Fabled Lands ex","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-18T13:45:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365089850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1813674389005441","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"The Sage Class Spotlight","summary":"Some adventurers master steel, others the arcane. The Sage seeks mastery of both body and spirit.Sages are not bound to one place alone. Some hail from the Monastery of Illumination on Kaxos, where spartan training hardens both mind and flesh. These are island ascetics, pale-robed monks who endure silence and hardship to wield the staff as both weapon and discipline. Others walk from the deserts of Opalar, where mystics temper philosophy with survival and zeal. They are guardians and visionaries","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-18T14:07:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674389005441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1811772772408659","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"New Milestone - 3000 Wishlists Reached!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/fc4472f325ce165d00401e3694323a5b3810b896.png We did it - 3,000 wishlists gathered! That’s one of the big milestones on this long road, and I’m grateful for every single one. Thank you to everyone who’s already signed up to follow the journey - it makes all the difference for a solo dev project like this. What’s Next? The Demo The next milestone is clear: a playable demo. Right now, the plan is to squeeze in around 8–10 combat encounters, spread across several alternat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-30T12:42:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772408659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1809235871653738","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"To Trick by the Blade - Trickster Class Spotlight","summary":"Are you a roguish knave, crouched in a tavern corner with dice palmed and a purse already half-emptied of its coin? Or an assassin in the night, dagger ready, poison gleaming on the blade as you wait for your mark to pass beneath the window?The Trickster can be either - Assassin or Knave - and many things besides. A tomb-robber, a troubleshooter, an explorer, a thief, a gambler, even a hero when necessity demands. Where the Warrior trusts in armour and warhorse, and the Enchanter in spellbook an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-30T14:37:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871653738","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1805065414332207","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Blood Sword – Mini-Devlog #1","summary":"I'm writing this on a hot (34 C° / 93.2 °F) July day, sipping a cup of slightly overbrewed coffee at my desk. In just a day, I'm off on a short vacation with my family - the kind of trip where you need another day or two to recover once you're back. But before I disappear into the dungeons beneath our mountains (and offline), I wanted to share a few thoughts and updates on how Blood Sword is coming along.The Grind BeginsWith the Warrior and Enchanter class spotlights out in the wild, I was tempt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-14T12:44:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805065414332207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1802893906731050","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"To Live by the Sword - Warrior Class Spotlight","summary":"In the world of Legend, warriors walk many paths.Some are Knights, heirs to a shattered code of chivalry, trained in the civilised realms of Albion, Chaubrette, or the war-torn reaches of Kurland. Clad in chain and bound by oaths - or merely the memory of them - they stride into battle like avatars of the old world.Others are Barbarians, sons and daughters of the Eastern Steppes, the icy coasts of Thuland, or the burning sands of distant deserts. They owe fealty to no liege, but fight with the r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-19T14:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802893906731050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1800991756441938","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Blood Sword Joins the Turn-Based Thursday Fest","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/d9ba79cbdf66e43c746d07a2e2393162315ef42d.png Hey adventurers, Big news — Blood Sword has been officially selected to take part in the Turn-Based Thursday Festival 2025, running June 2nd to June 9th! And that’s not all — the fest has been given front-page visibility on Steam as part of a curated spotlight for the event. That kind of opportunity is rare for an upcoming indie RPG like this, and I couldn’t be more thrilled to see Blood Sword standing among the best of the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-02T14:03:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800991756441938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1799088287802881","game_id":"steam-3645170","kind":"announcement","title":"Class Spotlight – The Enchanter","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45584604/fef85021949394781ffa55eb20467e88bb3258b1.png In the north, along the savage coasts of Mercania and Thuland, magic is primal and raw. The shamans and rune-mages there call themselves Elementalists, harnessing fire, wind, water, and darkness through sheer force of will. They are respected - or feared - as tricksters, spirit-binders, and storm-callers. Those who dare to wield darkness are reviled, cursed with spiritual penalties known as geases for walking forbidden path","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-07T15:11:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287802881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3645170-1797820624429885","game_id":"st